      "Task: Within a SINGLE ABSA aspect, discover recurring subproblems (subaspects).\n",
      "Language: Hungarian.\n\n",
      "ASPECT (NAMESPACE): ", aspect_name, "\n\n",
      "RULES:\n",
      "- Only generate labels that belong to THIS aspect.\n",
      "- Labels should be short, reusable noun phrases (2–5 words).\n",
