## Consolidation

"Task: consolidate the candidate subaspect labels into a FINAL taxonomy.\n",
"Language: Hungarian.\n\n",
"ASPECT (NAMESPACE): ", aspect_name, "\n\n",
"RULES (CRITICAL):\n",
"1) Generate 6–12 SUBASPECT labels.\n",
"2) The label OTHER_TOO_VAGUE must be included for cases where no SUBASPECT label is appropriate.\n",
"3) Labels must be mutually exclusive and non-overlapping.\n",
"4) Provide a one-sentence definition for each label.\n",
"5) Do not introduce new themes beyond the candidate labels and quotes.\n",
"6) All labels must belong to this aspect only.\n",
"7) STRICT JSON output, nothing else.\n\n",
"INPUT candidate labels:\n",
toJSON(candidates, auto_unbox = TRUE, pretty = TRUE), "\n\n",
"Representative quotes (context):\n",
paste0("- ", reps, collapse="\n"), "\n\n",
"Output schema:\n",
"{\n",
"  \"aspect\": \"...\",\n",
"  \"subaspects\": [\n",
"    {\"label\":\"...\",\"definition\":\"...\"}\n",
"  ]\n",
"}\n"
